delly
------------------------------------------
Delly is an integrated structural variant (SV) prediction method that can
discover, genotype and visualize deletions, tandem duplications, inversions
and translocations at single-nucleotide resolution in short-read massively
parallel sequencing data. It uses paired-ends, split-reads and read-depth to
sensitively and accurately delineate genomic rearrangements throughout the
genome. Structural variants can be annotated using Delly-sansa and visualized
using Delly-maze or Delly-suave.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libboost_date_time1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_filesystem1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_iostreams1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_program_options1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_system1.66-1.66.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libhts3-1.24-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libboost-devel-1.66.0-1
  libhts-devel-1.24-1bl1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/dellytools/delly

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/dellytools/delly/archive/refs/tags/v2.7.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack delly-2.7.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./delly-2.7.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/delly-2.7.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/delly-2.7.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(delly)
  /usr/bin/delly.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/delly.README
  /usr/share/doc/delly/CREDITS
  /usr/share/doc/delly/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/delly/README.md

